{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-27","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to one another, and each by multiplying itself make a certain number, the products will be prime to one another; and, if the original numbers by multiplying the products make certain numbers, the latter will also be prime to one another [and this is always the case with the extremes].","book":7,"number":27,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.27","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.27/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":27,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","contentId":"euclid-7-27","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5cefcefdbc96b7833ea6a10e64c5baacd37bfc9f44e49b0d34e94e6c2163e54","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-27.statement","euclid-7-27.construction.1","euclid-7-27.proof.1","euclid-7-27.proof.2","euclid-7-27.proof.3","euclid-7-27.proof.4","euclid-7-27.proof.5","euclid-7-27.conclusion","euclid-7-27.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-27.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a950e0350a1a8db8cb7d8395b2634bb81ce1a2f224cec43157204bd16a0182c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to one another, and each by multiplying itself make a certain number, the products will be prime to one another; and, if the original numbers by multiplying the products make certain numbers, the latter will also be prime to one another [and this is always the case with the extremes]."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字为互素, 每一乘以本身就得出一个一定的数字, 产品将是互素;如果最初的数字乘以产品得出一定的数字, 后者也将是互素[ , 极端情况总是如此]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13986466d62ce648230139f13fac58dbcab076a00b52e0fe31e6e629237c006b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers prime to one another, let A by multiplying itself make C, and by multiplying C make D, and let B by multiplying itself make E, and by multiplying E make F; I say that both C, E and D, F are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为2号互素,让A乘以C,D乘以C,D,让B乘以E,E乘以F;我说,C,E和D,F都是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb424e27f4ca290bff003e2edbc832221989bd1007357df7edd37ce01a1c92f9","citations":["euclid-7-25"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B are prime to one another, and A by multiplying itself has made C, therefore C, B are prime to one another. [[VII. 25](/principles/euclid-7-25)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自A以来,B为互素,A乘以乘以C,因此,C为互素。 [[VII. 25](/principles/euclid-7-25)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9caf9a4c90bb64d50e338876bdb4c0dcf2b3592d4bbcb323b51f08645fe2a292","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then C, B are prime to one another, and B by multiplying itself has made E, therefore C, E are prime to one another. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,C,B是互素,B乘以本身就达到E,因此C,E是互素。 [同上。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"092e66a3d544980d65db3f2508973b61f185b7a91c3c14f97a71d2828cc38d45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A, B are prime to one another, and B by multiplying itself has made E, therefore A, E are prime to one another. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B是互素,B乘以E,A,E是互素。 [同上。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"260a87935965293a2d806af2bf2cf401bdbcacd51f41ce22f8bd36b4e215ec4f","citations":["euclid-7-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the two numbers A, C are prime to the two numbers B, E, both to each, therefore also the product of A, C is prime to the product of B, E. [[VII. 26](/principles/euclid-7-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,这两个数字A,C是这两个数字的首选数字,B,E,两者均为首选数字,因此,A,C的产品也是B,E的首选数字。 [[VII. 26](/principles/euclid-7-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f48c9c1fd97635952a0e0986ab49abf46d46fb5c30c48298fe4ace5dd1c54d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the product of A, C is D, and the product of B, E is F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,C的产物是D,B,E的产物是F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8941033f9fc2808d8052763a394d0a97060f843171958e072247f93814ee180","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D, F are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,D,F是互素。 Q,E。 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-27.source","contentId":"euclid-7-27","revisionId":"euclid-7-27@raw-e5cefcefdbc96b78","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd50f6d56162726c9ac5ff340eddcfb9c41636a1cbb4c03afba950ed84561ba1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.27/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.27\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-27:euclid-7-25:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-27.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-25","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.27",